 Unpacked Chrome / Edge / Brave extension for https://nfsu2.xyz/. See `CHANGELOG.md` for this release's changes and verification limits.
 
-## v0.25.0: Saved extension settings profiles
+## v0.26.0: Keep custom road settings out of Drift
+
+On exact **93af6ccb** and **78e2bb69**, custom road/free-roam pace now pauses during native Drift modes. The extension preserves the game's own pace factor instead of multiplying it by a saved road pace setting. Your selected switches and numbers remain saved and resume outside Drift. The UI shows “Paused in Drift”; an earlier road pace hit is not reported as current Drift confirmation.
+
+Extra grip also pauses for the additional native Drift variant flag that was previously missed. Its existing ownership and restoration guards remain. Native Drag precedence is retained. The diagnostic log now includes a bounded, read-only native pace-factor observation to help compare runs.
+
+These are two reproduced setting interactions, **not a proven fix for every poor Drift run**. No new steering, throttle, shifting, NOS behavior, score multiplier, opponent logic, recovery curve or race tune is introduced. Engine power and your actual car tune remain selected and can still affect handling. Native grip/downforce scaling remains unverified and disabled.
+
+Saved tool profiles, full preset tuning, online road-race/collision controls and Drag blowout protection remain combined. The combined suite passes **1,698 tests, zero failures/skips/cancellations**. No live Drift run, score improvement, browser installation or game-save persistence is claimed. For a useful comparison, use the same car, track and tune; export a short diagnostic log after a run that reproduces the problem.
+
+## Retained v0.25.0: Saved extension settings profiles
 
 **Saved tool profiles** saves named groups of extension settings in this browser for this game site. Save your current choices, then load them together instead of enabling each tool separately. Update replaces the selected saved configuration; Delete removes it. These profiles are separate from the game's race tuning presets and **Save Profile**. They contain no car setup, game save, dyno draft or diagnostic log.
 
